as in later versions, but complicated further, not just by lack of SDSM
(introduced in 3.3.0) but the need to have fire resistance to survive in
Hell.  The last two times I tried 3.0.10, I did not have intrinsic fire
resistance when I reached the Castle.  The first time, I stepped on a
random pit and was too quickly burned to a crisp to even be surprised.
